Hi {{first_name}},

Thank you for reaching out. I would be happy to learn what you have in mind and help you decide on a useful next step. Are you considering buying, selling, or simply exploring your options?

{{signature}}

Hi {{first_name}},

Checking in to see what would be most helpful with your home search. Have your priorities or timing changed? Let me know what you would like to focus on next.

{{signature}}

Hi {{first_name}},

If you are still considering a move, I would be happy to talk through your timing and questions. What would help you feel more prepared for the next step?

{{signature}}

Hi {{first_name}},

A quick hello to see whether real estate is still on your radar. If your plans have changed, that is completely fine. Let me know if there is anything I can help clarify.

{{signature}}

Hi {{first_name}},

A friendly reminder about our appointment on {{appointment_date}}. Please let me know if you need to adjust the time or have a question beforehand.

{{signature}}

Hi {{first_name}},

What did you think of {{property_address}}? I would like to hear what worked for you, what did not, and any questions you would like to explore.

{{signature}}

Hi {{first_name}},

Would you like to take a look at this property?
{{property_link}}

Let me know what you think or whether you would like more information.

{{signature}}

Hi {{first_name}},

Congratulations on your new home at {{property_address}}! Wishing you a wonderful start and many happy memories there. Please reach out if questions come up as you settle in.

{{signature}}

Hi {{first_name}},

Congratulations on the sale of {{property_address}}! Thank you for letting me be part of this chapter. Wishing you all the best with what comes next.

{{signature}}

Hi {{first_name}},

How are you settling into {{property_address}}? I hope things are going well. If any questions have come up, I would be happy to help where I can.

{{signature}}

Hi {{first_name}},

Wishing you a happy {{anniversary}} at {{property_address}}. I hope your home has been a wonderful place for you. It would be lovely to hear how things are going.

{{signature}}

Hi {{first_name}},

Thank you for the referral. Your trust means a great deal to me, and I appreciate you thinking of me.

{{signature}}

Hi {{first_name}},

If you have a moment, I would appreciate hearing about your experience working with me. Your feedback helps me understand what was useful and what I could do better.

{{signature}}

Hi {{first_name}},

Sending warm wishes for {{holiday}}. I hope you find time to enjoy the season in whatever way feels right for you.

{{signature}}

Hi {{first_name}},

Wishing you a healthy, happy new year. If a move is part of your plans, I would be glad to help you think through the next steps when you are ready.

{{signature}}

Hi {{first_name}},

I wanted to share this update with you:

{{topic}}

If you have questions or would like to talk about what this means for your plans, please let me know.

{{signature}}
